<h2>About</h2>
<p1>An exploration-horror game in the University of Hull! Run from <s><i>your deadlines</i></s> the monster as you venture through the halls of key university buildings, including Wilberforce, and Fenner! Collect items and keys whilst also learning about the university and its departments.</p1>
<br><br /><br /><h2>Our Goal</h2>
<p1>We aim to create a fun game with a focus on exploring the halls and departments of the university. This is in aid of helping new students become familiarised with the university's layout and role of the departments. To help with this, we will place QR codes around the university in corresponding areas within the game; players can then use their memory of the area to visit these real life locations to learn more about the department or area.</p1>
